{"id":"n75898-1-8","stage":4,"title":"정전 · 停电","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75898-1-8-1","ko":"오늘 아침에 왜 늦었어요?","zh":"今天早上怎么迟到了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침에","audio":"/audio/930cc492b37cd832fc24.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었어요?","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었어요","audio":"/audio/3e3ddd10ee92a4b634b8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f57dd7b4abede00399d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75898-1-8-2","ko":"정전 때문에 지하철이 멈췄었거든요.","zh":"因为停电，地铁停运了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정전","meaning":"停电","explanation":"정전：停电","readings":[{"term":"정전","audio":"/audio/9af134f1d803dc831add.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75898","senseId":"1","lemma":"정전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정전","audio":"/audio/9af134f1d803dc831add.mp3"}},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때문에","audio":"/audio/870904a840bc33218066.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철이","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철이","audio":"/audio/5d3562ef875944b5f5a4.mp3"}},{"text":"멈췄었거든요.","meaning":"停，止","explanation":"멈추다：停，止；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"2","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈췄었거든요","audio":"/audio/4545bdf01eed942cde81.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9af134f1d803dc83","term":"정전","zh":"停电","audio":"/audio/9af134f1d803dc831add.mp3","entryId":"75898","definition":"电源中断。","pronunciation":["정전"]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3",